# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Drop — static SPA, no runtime environment variables needed.
#
# Configuration (GitHub/GitLab token, owner, repo, branch) is entered by each
# designer in the in-app Settings dialog and stored in their browser's
# localStorage. The browser talks to GitHub/GitLab APIs directly — no server,
# no database, no env secrets at runtime.
#
# The only env var below is a *build-time* one for hosting on a GitHub Pages
# project site (https://your-username.github.io/drop/). Skip it if you host at
# a custom domain or at the root of a domain (Netlify, Vercel, custom domain).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# When hosting at https://your-username.github.io/drop/, set this to /drop so
# Next.js rewrites asset URLs with the correct base path. Leave unset otherwise.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_PATH=/drop
